WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:09.687
The queen wanted the king to make a proclamation.

2
00:00:09.688 --> 00:00:18.099
So he told everyone in the kingdom about the gold plate.

3
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:23.122
"We need a brave hero to save the princess," he said.

4
00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:25.871
"Who will volunteer?"

5
00:00:25.872 --> 00:00:33.875
But no one stepped forward.

6
00:00:33.876 --> 00:00:40.657
As time went on, the princess grew sicker.

7
00:00:40.658 --> 00:00:48.998
At last the prince returned.

8
00:00:48.999 --> 00:00:56.265
When he heard the proclamation, his heart leaped.

9
00:00:56.266 --> 00:01:01.582
"Finally—something I can do!" he thought.

10
00:01:01.583 --> 00:01:03.370
"I'll lose my life.

11
00:01:03.371 --> 00:01:09.425
But without the princess, I have no life.

12
00:01:09.426 --> 00:01:14.680
And I will see her one last time before I die."

13
00:01:14.681 --> 00:01:18.305
The prince dressed like a servant again.

14
00:01:18.306 --> 00:01:28.293
Then he hurried to the palace.

15
00:01:28.294 --> 00:01:32.768
The king stared at the handsome servant before him.

16
00:01:32.769 --> 00:01:35.828
"Tell me what you want, young man."

17
00:01:35.829 --> 00:01:39.061
"I want to be the cork," the prince said.

18
00:01:39.062 --> 00:01:43.769
The king gasped. "What? You'll be the hero?"

19
00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:49.256
"Yes. I will give my life to return water to the lake," the prince said.

20
00:01:49.257 --> 00:01:54.189
"That's wonderful!" the king said.

21
00:01:54.190 --> 00:02:00.696
"Would you like to go and see your parents first?"

22
00:02:00.697 --> 00:02:07.476
"No," the prince said. "But I do have one condition."

23
00:02:07.477 --> 00:02:11.489
"Anything!" the king said.

24
00:02:11.490 --> 00:02:15.383
"I'll climb into the hole," the prince began.

25
00:02:15.384 --> 00:02:19.874
"Then, by magic, water will return to the lake.

26
00:02:19.875 --> 00:02:25.459
When it reaches my head, I will drown."

27
00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:31.495
The king looked down. "I'm afraid so, yes."

28
00:02:31.496 --> 00:02:35.410
"It will be a long wait," the prince went on.

29
00:02:35.411 --> 00:02:40.779
"Yes." The king bit his lip. "Waiting is hard.

30
00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:46.784
But with you as cork, the lake will never leak again."

31
00:02:46.785 --> 00:02:51.647
"I want the princess to sit with me," the prince went on.

32
00:02:51.648 --> 00:02:57.012
"She can feed me. She can look at me now and then to comfort me.

33
00:02:57.013 --> 00:03:04.661
When the water reaches my eyes, she may go."

34
00:03:04.662 --> 00:03:08.328
"I will grant your condition," the king said.

35
00:03:08.329 --> 00:03:11.369
"Now go and prepare yourself.

36
00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:17.381
My guards will search for the hole."

37
00:03:17.382 --> 00:03:26.774
It took the guards a long time to find the hole.

38
00:03:26.775 --> 00:03:30.951
But they finally found it in the center of the lake bed.

39
00:03:30.952 --> 00:03:35.269
It was in the middle of a large stone.

40
00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:42.294
The guards hurried back to tell the king.

41
00:03:42.295 --> 00:03:51.953
It was time to save the lake—and the princess.

